# Cloudflare Pages response headers for the two static pages of the universal AI work link (PROJEXA-BUILD-001 U-47b, decision OD-3).
# The pages are served by the OD-3 static host only. Nothing here is indexed, cached or framed, and no page sets a cookie or loads a third-party script.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cache-Control: no-store
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
